WEBVTT

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.190
Ice Prison!

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.900
Hmph. That's what you get for not
giving up the Big Bad's whereabouts.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.780
"Ice Paladin Gakushu Asano (The Big Five)"

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.040
Asano! We have a good idea
where this Big Bad may be.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.210
--What?
--Seems a new teacher has shown up
out of the blue at the satellite campus

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.750
"Koyama"
"Araki"

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.750
--Seems a new teacher has shown up
out of the blue at the satellite campus

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.250
"Sakakibara"
"Araki"

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.210
of Kunugigaoka Magic Academy.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.210
"Sakakibara"
"Seo"

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.670
--Wait.
--Eh?

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.300
<i>I</i> figured that out <i>first</i>!

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.670
So it's a competition?!

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.720
Now for a race to that campus!

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.050
First one there is first in the bath!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.970
No fair taking a horse!

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:55.110
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:04.540
"Nagisa"

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:06.210
"Karma"

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:07.210
"Kaede"

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.540
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.210
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:12.710
"Chiba" "Hayami"

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.210
"Hinata" "Meg"

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:16.720
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:18.720
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:20.720
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.720
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:39.030
"The Big Five Attack!"

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.490
Hey, did you hear about the paladins?

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:46.910
Sure did. They're headed for this village--
and it's the Big Five, no less!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.120
Say what? Paladins?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.840
A company of knights under the Pope
with the Goddess's divine protection.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:56.800
The Big Five are a select subgroup
of particular talent.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:00.640
Correct, Isogai--as 
expected, coming from you.

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.550
Why would they be coming here?

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:06.180
Hmm. Why don't we
spend today on the intel-gathering

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.640
we couldn't do last week?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:08.940
Intel-gathering?

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.270
Which means it's
<i>this</i> person's turn in the spotlight!

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.480
Hello, boys!

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:17.440
Irina Jelavich, the Seductive Witch!

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:18.900
--In exchange for being pardoned
for her wrongdoings,

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.410
--In exchange for being pardoned
for her wrongdoings,

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.460
--Hi, girls! Irinie's here!

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.200
--we've taken her on
as this class's magic teacher.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:28.210
Sooo, that octopus there
asked me to gather some info?

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.870
I went to bars every night and was all like:

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:35.800
"I'll do <i>anything</i> for the latest,
<i>hottest</i> info--"

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.340
"--give it to me."

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.590
It's Professor Bitch!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:42.050
Give older guys enough booze

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.930
and they'll tell you lots of stuff!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.810
"Go on, have another!"

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.390
You guys went, too?

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.560
Those two asked to go along
so they could learn seduction from a pro.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:52.400
What about you?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.440
I was kind of like a chaperone.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.940
I just ate my dinner and watched.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.150
I was there to provide backup.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.780
And lower their fighting strength.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.160
You'd just sober 'em up!

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.950
I heard plenty about
the paladins, too, you know.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:09.890
And? What would bring them
to a nothing town like this?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:14.130
Easy: They're after you--the E Class.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.290
Huh?!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:20.220
Rumors are swirling in the village
that the Big Bad is in this class.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:24.600
The E Class is a top-secret mission
known only to the Pope and to us.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:28.270
If we're not careful, we could be jailed
for the crime of concealing the Big Bad.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.980
What?! I don't wanna be put in any cage!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.190
We've got to hide the fact
that Koro Sensei is the Big Bad!

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.110
There's no other way...

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.070
--Huh? Hey! What are you looking at?!
--<i>stare</i>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.780
It's pretty weird to have so many legs.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.570
Shall I tear off a tentacle or two?

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.530
Just what are you suggesting?!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.300
Appearances are everything!

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.870
Go for the serious look!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.370
He'd be better off with a nose, too.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.750
And hair, parted to one side!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.830
Having the Knight Commander
and a witch around just complicates things.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.920
Take a hike!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:54.750
Wha-a-at?!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.880
Me, too?!

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:57.290
--Koro-Q!
--Koro-Q!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.710
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.170
It would seem I'm first yet again.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.630
The race was over as soon as
you took off on that horse!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.260
Then there were all those
ice traps along the way!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.390
Just how badly did you
want to bathe first, anyway?!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.930
That's not the issue here.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.850
If we take on a challenge,
we must do so in earnest.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.230
Our failure is a failure for all humankind.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:20.530
And so we must use
all of our strength, no matter the foe.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.320
<i>That</i> is the duty of the paladins
who protect the people!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.700
"VolcanOH!" "Whitewater" "Emerald Hopes"

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.700
He says as he chooses a bath salt!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.620
But, you know, he's right.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:31.370
Asano's got it spot-on.
That's our leader, all right!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.790
All right, let's find that Big Bad
once and for all and get back home!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.130
Yeah!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.500
--Wait.
--Eh?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.210
<i>I'm</i> gonna find the Big Bad first!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.210
You just want to win, that's all!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.050
Let's go!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.680
No fair taking a horse!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.390
Koro-Q.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.680
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.560
Eh, that'll do.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.270
Sure doesn't look like a Big Bad.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.730
Want me to take lookout, Chiba?

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.700
They're here!

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:02.900
So it's "come as you are"!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.820
Doesn't this joker know what a door is?!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:05.990
<i>You</i> should talk!

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.450
Koro-Q!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.990
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.830
All units, charge!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.500
We are the Big Five. We have come
to defeat the Big Bad in hiding.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.000
First tell us why
you came in still on your horse.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:25.090
He likes to look down on people
from up higher than anyone else.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:29.050
Asano isn't satisfied
unless he's first in everything.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.550
Got that right.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:33.350
Asano's always first in the bath.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.810
With his <i>horse</i>?!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:38.060
And who has the top bunk
in a five-bunk bed but Asano, of course.

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.810
All five of you live together?!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.320
With his <i>horse</i>?!

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.230
Say, this throng you have with you here--

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.450
they sure are quick to talk.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.370
This is the only episode they're in,
so they're making the most of it.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:51.080
What do you mean, "episode"?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.830
Now then... you must be the Big Bad.

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.370
Whatever could you mean?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.120
Don't bother playing dumb.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.420
This is the Light Orb:

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.670
a gem the Goddess
has bestowed upon us humans

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.630
so that we may weaken the Big Bad.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.380
Yowza!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:07.050
Take <i>this</i>!

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.340
Sir!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:15.020
Yep yep yep yep yep yep yep!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.640
"Miss!"

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.890
"Koro Sensei dodged!"

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.610
"Having fulfilled its purpose,
the Light Orb shattered"

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.980
. . .

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.900
. . .

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.820
Wait. Huh? What just happened?

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.490
I'm sorry. I went and dodged it.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.490
Don't be dodging a key item!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:38.000
Oh, I am <i>so sorry</i>!
I'll fix it right now! Let's see...

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.580
There we go! All fixed up!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.500
You've gone too far!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.710
Now what? Is that really the Big Bad?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.170
I mean, the Orb reacted to him...

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:49.380
What kind of Big Bad has
black-rimmed glasses and parted hair?

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.050
His face <i>is</i> a bit too round for a Big Bad...

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.850
Hey, these guys are on a<i> roll</i>
with all the talking!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.930
They're talking more than we are!

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:02.020
"Illustrated Guide to Monsters"

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.690
I've memorized every last monster,

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.100
and <i>that</i> one isn't in any book!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.900
--Leave it to you, Koyama!
--Wait.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.320
<i>I've</i> memorized every last monster, too!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.360
It's not a competition!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:14.240
So what now? We've lost the Orb
and don't know who the Big Bad is.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.490
Then we'll have to test him with strength.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.670
"Magic Frostblade"

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.620
There it is:

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.250
the Magic Frostblade that Asano alone
in the entire world can create!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.630
What's this?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.090
I made one, simple as pie!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.220
Say <i>what</i>?!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.550
--What what what <i>what</i>?!
--That reaction's pushing it, too!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.220
--We won't be outdone! OMG! Yaaargh!
--Dial it down, you two.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:40.350
So maybe no one's made this
just 'cause it's doofy as hell?

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.650
You seem confident in your own skill,

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:45.940
but you could stand to learn
how it pales in comparison

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.230
to that of an armamentalist.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.280
Yes, all right, that's enough!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.860
Could I ask you to be on your way?

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:57.370
Or I could bring in the Pope
for a nice long chat...

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.620
Th-The <i>Pope</i>?!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.710
Huh?!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:05.710
Oh! It's the Pope!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.250
Just kidding!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.670
Hmm?

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.170
That's way too terrified!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.510
To think the Big Five could be so afraid!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.840
Just how frightening <i>is</i> this Pope?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.100
Asano...

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:19.470
Today's Big Bad hunt
wasn't on the Pope's orders,

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:22.690
but something the Big Five
decided to do on its own, yes?

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.020
Now, if the Church
didn't issue a directive on this,

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:30.990
that makes today's debacle
the reckless act of an over-eager Big Five.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:34.360
The Pope has an extreme
aversion to lax discipline.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:38.490
What would he think if he found out
about the Big Five going rogue?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.410
Oh, and I heard something else interesting:

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.750
The last time someone took
the Light Orb without permission,

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.000
I understand the Pope
became very angry indeed.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:56.260
Don't you think you should hurry back
and tell him the Orb is broken?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.810
Those faces--like it's the end of the world!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:03.100
We'll withdraw for now.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:06.770
First one back gets to
play dumb on the Orb thing!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.690
Like we're faster than a horse!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.270
Quit screwing around, Asano!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.690
No fair, Asano!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.490
Hooray! We drove off the Big Five!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.030
Amazing... And without a fight!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:23.080
And so information can be as mighty
a weapon as any sword or spell.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.910
Information's a mighty weapon, all right.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.330
But...

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:32.340
You're on the hook for Irina's intel fee.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.050
Where did this total come from?!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:37.590
Sorry, sir! The bar had
some <i>really</i> good grub!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.850
Just how much did you eat?!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:44.930
...for Koro Sensei, it 
came at too high a price.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.280
Pay: cut.
